  "description": "This package contains an ASP.NET Web API controller exposing the reports generation engine for ASP.NET (both MVC and WebForms) or pure client-side Web applications.\n            This package is part of the Progress® Telerik® Reporting solution.\n            To preview reports in the Web application you also need a corresponding flavor of the HTML5 Report Viewer (jQuery widget, MVC, Angular or WebForms wrapper). All flavors' assets come with the full product installer found at https://www.telerik.com/account/product-download?product=REPORTING. Alternatively, the server-side wrappers (MVC and WebForms) can be obtained using the corresponding NuGet package and the Telerik Angular Report Viewer is available in npmjs repository - https://www.npmjs.com/package/@progress/telerik-angular-report-viewer.\n            Upgrading the project to a newer NuGet package version will upgrade the runtime libraries but for type report definitions (definitions created with the Visual Studio integrated Report Designer) you must run the Telerik Reporting Upgrade Wizard tool. The tool is part of the full product installer as well.",
